    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "The game begins when the player regains consciousness after his spaceship crashes on an unknown planet.<br>The player is immediately spoken to by a fallen suit, and when he puts it on, he gains the power to create bombs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/058866e49cad3eab05c3630895ab8ed7.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/058866e49cad3eab05c3630895ab8ed7.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/058866e49cad3eab05c3630895ab8ed7.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However, the weight of the suit prevents you from jumping on your own, and you must use the bomb's blast to jump and overcome obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/e5d526f9f161bb0593ce3bd695391bb7.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/e5d526f9f161bb0593ce3bd695391bb7.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/e5d526f9f161bb0593ce3bd695391bb7.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The suit can withstand any kind of blast and can even dash with the blast on its back.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/96faaf281f2044885717332e59694c48.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/96faaf281f2044885717332e59694c48.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/96faaf281f2044885717332e59694c48.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Of course, you will also be able to attack with bombs, and your days will be full of bombs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/6d2400efb0def9cd457517d3a79c281e.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/6d2400efb0def9cd457517d3a79c281e.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/6d2400efb0def9cd457517d3a79c281e.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Change your suit and use your new powers to open up new paths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/27302298171ebdade2ba5ea624c50d0f.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/27302298171ebdade2ba5ea624c50d0f.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/27302298171ebdade2ba5ea624c50d0f.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "The game begins when the player regains consciousness after his spaceship crashes on an unknown planet.<br>The player is immediately spoken to by a fallen suit, and when he puts it on, he gains the power to create bombs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/058866e49cad3eab05c3630895ab8ed7.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/058866e49cad3eab05c3630895ab8ed7.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/058866e49cad3eab05c3630895ab8ed7.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>However, the weight of the suit prevents you from jumping on your own, and you must use the bomb's blast to jump and overcome obstacles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/e5d526f9f161bb0593ce3bd695391bb7.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/e5d526f9f161bb0593ce3bd695391bb7.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/e5d526f9f161bb0593ce3bd695391bb7.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The suit can withstand any kind of blast and can even dash with the blast on its back.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/96faaf281f2044885717332e59694c48.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/96faaf281f2044885717332e59694c48.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/96faaf281f2044885717332e59694c48.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Of course, you will also be able to attack with bombs, and your days will be full of bombs.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/6d2400efb0def9cd457517d3a79c281e.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/6d2400efb0def9cd457517d3a79c281e.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/6d2400efb0def9cd457517d3a79c281e.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Change your suit and use your new powers to open up new paths.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/27302298171ebdade2ba5ea624c50d0f.poster.avif?t=1702449293\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/27302298171ebdade2ba5ea624c50d0f.webm?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2723310/extras/27302298171ebdade2ba5ea624c50d0f.mp4?t=1702449293\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
